{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","秩序终章"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥菲戈斯会在战斗中点亮她的曲谱，提高攻击力和急速。主动使用时，展开“神音领域”沉默范围内的敌人，随后对目标造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地：奥菲戈斯每作战1秒便会在自己的曲谱中点亮1个节拍，每当敌人受到打断效果影响或被击败时会点亮1个节拍（每位友军对每个敌方目标每秒最多触发1次），累计点亮12个节拍时，奥菲戈斯将会激活她的曲谱，提高50% + 5%的攻击力并提高30 + 3点急速。并且技能中的演奏效果会产生【共鸣】，将本次技能的效果溅射至目标周围2格的至多2名敌军。主动释放时：奥菲戈斯滑翔向敌人最密集的2格区域的敌人位置，对范围内敌人造成400% + 40% ATK的伤害，并形成范围2格的“神音领域”，持续10 + 1秒，领域内的敌人会被持续沉默，奥菲戈斯在领域内处于霸体状态。随后奥菲戈斯会演奏5段【乐章】，对目标敌人造成110% + 20% ATK的伤害并削减等同于伤害量的生命上限。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":104,"end":109,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":118,"end":122,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":210,"end":216,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":243,"end":247,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg8"},{"start":304,"end":310,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"},{"start":206,"end":220,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":259,"end":261,"tooltip_key":"keyword:silence"},{"start":272,"end":274,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":300,"end":314,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","【乐章】的伤害提升至120% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","【乐章】的伤害提升至130% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","【乐章】的伤害提升至140% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","【乐章】的伤害提升至150% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","踏罪节律"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥菲戈斯打出三次连击，对目标造成伤害并削减其能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥菲戈斯使用音叉开始【连奏】，对目标打出富有节奏的三次连击，每次造成150% + 20% ATK伤害并且削减其120点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次【连奏】伤害提高至160% + 20% ATK，能量削减提升至130。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次【连奏】伤害提高至170% + 20% ATK，能量削减提升至140。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次【连奏】伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK，能量削减提升至150。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","静默之刺"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥菲戈斯将音叉刺入目标体内，引发共鸣爆炸并击倒目标周围的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用音叉刺入敌人体内，造成短暂控制效果和200% + 20% ATK伤害，随后将音律注入音叉引发【断奏】，对目标及周围1格的所有敌人造成320% + 40% ATK伤害并将其击倒2秒，奥菲戈斯在释放该技能时免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","【断奏】伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","【断奏】伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","【断奏】伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提高急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，奥菲戈斯提高6点急速，每次点亮音符时，提高1点急速，曲谱激活后额外提高6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，奥菲戈斯提高8点急速，每次点亮音符时，提高1点急速，曲谱激活后额外提高8点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，奥菲戈斯提高10点急速，每次点亮音符时，提高1点急速，曲谱激活后额外提高10点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","谐乐奏鸣"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","曲谱激活后，奥菲戈斯会演奏他的曲谱，驱散自身的减益效果并回复生命值和能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","曲谱被激活后将会开始演奏，之后每8秒会自动演奏1次。每次演奏曲谱时会移除自身所有可驱散的负面状态，并回复40%最大生命值和250点能量。当乐谱在激活状态下再次收集节拍时，会加快曲谱10%的演奏速度，并提高自身3点急速，最多可叠加10次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","恢复生命值提升至50%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","恢复生命值提升至60%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","曲谱在演奏时还会对自身周围2格最近的2名敌人造成20%最大生命值的真实伤害（最高不超过1000% ATK）。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","曲谱激活后，奥菲戈斯的普通攻击造成额外真实伤害并附带生命汲取。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","曲谱激活后，奥菲戈斯会在普攻时演奏【震音】，额外造成目标18%最大生命值的真实伤害（最高不超过600% ATK）并且附带50点汲取。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":47,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","神音之鸣"]]}